						for it... I've tried everything from paper=20
						planners to over a dozen software packages.=20
						I've settled on the Achieve Productivity=20
						Suite to help put my life in order!"</font></p>
						<p style=3D"margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0">
						<font size=3D"2">- Eric Eckberg</font></p></td>
					</tr>
				</tbody></table>
						</div>
						<p align=3D"left"><font size=3D"2">The Productivity Suite=20
						edition of Achieve Planner also includes several life=20
						planning and goal setting tools like:</font></p>
						<ul>
							<li>
							<p align=3D"left"><font size=3D"2">Your strategic life=20
							plan</font></p></li>
						<li>
						<p align=3D"left"><font size=3D"2">Capture, organize and=20
						plan your goals and dreams</font></p></li>
						<li>
						<p align=3D"left"><font size=3D"2">Break goals down into=20
						projects and tasks</font></p></li>
					<li>
