				<li>
				<p align=3D"left"><font size=3D"2">Link motivational images to your=20
				goals</font></p></li>
			</ul>
						<p align=3D"left">
						<font size=3D"2">
						<a target=3D"_blank" href=3D"http://www.effexis.com/achieve/images/Re=
sultAreaIF.png">
						<img border=3D"0" src=3D"http://www.effexis.com/achieve/images/Result=
AreaIFMainPageTN.png" width=3D"300" height=3D"211" alt=3D"Discover your mis=
sion for each life area" align=3D"right" hspace=3D"10"></a>Achieve planner =
uses <b>result=20
						areas</b> to represent your life dimensions or roles. This helps you =
balance goals and projects across=20
						the important areas of your life.</font></p><p align=3D"left">
						<font size=3D"2">You can develop mission/vision statements=20
						for each area, capture your guiding principles/values,=20
						and perform a Strengths/Weaknesses/ Opportunities/Threats (SWOT) anal=
ysis.</font></p><p style=3D"margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 5px">
						<font size=3D"2">
						<br>
						</font><b><font size=3D"2" color=3D"#000080">Set,=20
						Plan and Track All Your Goals</font></b></p>
						<p align=3D"left">
						<font size=3D"2">
						<a target=3D"_blank" href=3D"http://www.effexis.com/achieve/images/Go=
alInformationForm.png">
						<img border=3D"0" src=3D"http://www.effexis.com/achieve/images/GoalIn=
formationFormMainPageTN.png" width=3D"300" height=3D"184" alt=3D"Goal plann=
ing form" hspace=3D"10" align=3D"left"></a>The=20
						goals list allows you to set, organize, plan, and track=20
						your goals.</font></p><p align=3D"left">
						<font size=3D"2">
